            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Divergence 1.5.1 (88)</h3>
<ul>
<li>The launcher menu now shows a map of the other machine's monitors, laid out the way they actually sit. Click one to switch to it.</li>
<li>The same map is available in Divergence mode with ⌘⌥M, where the launcher menu can't be opened. Escape closes it; press Escape again to leave Divergence mode.</li>
<li>On Windows hosts, right-clicking a window's title bar now offers "Send to Divergence display".</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
